<h2 id="privacy-information">Information &amp; purposes</h2>
<p>When you shop, Shopify and the services used to fulfill your order process information such as your name, email, phone number where supplied, delivery and billing addresses, order details and payment transaction information. Customer-care messages include the information you choose to send. Technical information may include IP address, device and browser details, pages visited and cookie identifiers.</p>
<p>We use information to operate the store, fulfill orders, arrange returns, provide support, prevent fraud and meet recordkeeping obligations. If you subscribe to marketing, we use your contact details for that purpose; use the unsubscribe link to stop marketing messages. Order-related messages are separate.</p>
<h2 id="privacy-sharing">Service providers</h2>
<p>We share information needed for their work with Shopify, payment providers, Trendsi as our fulfillment partner, and delivery carriers. Providers may process information in the US and other countries where they operate. We may disclose information when legally required or necessary to protect rights and prevent fraud. For Shopify’s own processing and choices, read the <a href="https://www.shopify.com/legal/privacy/consumers">Shopify Consumer Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
<h2 id="privacy-cookies">Cookies &amp; browser storage</h2>
<p>Storefront cookies support functions such as the shopping bag, security and preferences. This theme also stores saved pieces in your browser; they do not synchronize across devices. You can remove this information through your browser’s site-data controls, which may reset your bag and preferences.</p>
<p>Where additional analytics, advertising or Shopify data-sharing features are enabled, the store’s privacy controls and notices explain the available consent and opt-out choices. Use those controls where shown. Browser cookie restrictions may affect store functionality.</p>
<h2 id="privacy-retention">Retention &amp; security</h2>
<p>We retain information as needed for orders, support, legal obligations and dispute resolution. Retention depends on the purpose and applicable requirements. We use reasonable safeguards, but no internet transmission or storage method can be guaranteed completely secure.</p>
<h2 id="privacy-choices">Your choices &amp; requests</h2>
<p>Depending on where you live and the laws that apply, you may have rights to access, correct, delete or obtain a copy of your information, or to opt out of certain processing, targeted advertising or sale/sharing. {% render 'policy-contact' %} to make a request or ask about our practices. We may need to verify your identity and explain any legal exceptions. An authorized agent may contact us where permitted. You may ask us to review a decision about your request.</p>
<p>The store is intended for adults, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. Contact us if you believe a child provided information. Updates to this notice will be dated here.</p>
